# Darío Macchi

> Personal website of Darío Macchi — Developer Relations engineer, MSc in Software Engineering, speaker, and professor at Universidad ORT Uruguay. Presented as a "KanbanCV": a living, kanban-style resume covering experience, education, research, and projects, alongside essays on AI, software engineering practice, and developer careers.

Based in Montevideo, Uruguay.

## About

- [About me](https://dariomac.com/about-me): Bio, background, and current focus in Developer Relations, speaking, and teaching.
- [KanbanCV introduction](https://dariomac.com/kanbancv): Explanation of the kanban-board format used to present this resume.
- [Full KanbanCV](https://dariomac.com/): Complete resume board — experience, education, research, projects, and quotes.

